==Qualification==
==Venues==
The venues were hosted at 10 different stadiums in 9 different cities: [[Kinugasa]], [[Aoyama]], [[Arima]], [[Kashima]], [[Shirakawa]], [[Ishiyama]], [[Rifu]], [[Ainami]], and [[Souya]]. Of 9 different cities, 4 are in [[Greater Aoyama|Aoyama]] metropolitan area (Aoyama, Arima, Kashima and Shirakawa) where Shirakawa city host 2 different stadiums, [[Shirakawa International Stadium]] and [[Yoshimitsu-Ohana Park Stadium]]. 9 stadiums are retrofitted to accommodate the attendances while only 1 build from scratch which is Kinugasa International Stadium. 

The opening was held on [[Yura Park Stadium]] in [[Ishiyama Prefecture]] while the final match and closing was held on [[Kinugasa International Stadium]] in [[Kinugasa Prefecture]].